(LICENSE.twn_election): bazel/*.bzl, third_party/skia/*, tools/embed/*,
tools/gen_skia_srcs.py, src/render/vk_loader.*, src/render/vk_context.*, and
the frame plumbing in src/render/compositor.cc. Each carries a note in its
header.

